    "summary": "Sylvamo North America LLC (Account 3344396) has OptumRx as their pharmacy vendor (800.797.9791) with a unique Specialty Drug Medical Provision effective 1.1.22. Under this provision, Cigna's medical plans cover the first injection/infusion of any specialty drug in the doctor's office and/or home setting, with all subsequent doses obtained through OptumSpecialty Pharmacy (855.427.4682). The provision applies ONLY to doctor's office and home settings, NOT to outpatient, inpatient, or emergency room settings. For oncology medications, injectable/infused drugs dispensed through cancer clinics are payable under the medical plan, while oral oncology medications included on the 2019 Specialty Drug Provision List are payable one time per lifetime under the medical plan, with all others dispensed through OptumSpecialty Pharmacy. The specialty drug list contains 773 unique drugs across 55 therapeutic classes including major categories such as Oncology (Injectable, Oral, and Topical), Hemophilia, Inflammatory Conditions, Immunological Agents, Immune Globulin, Endocrine, Enzyme Therapy, Multiple Sclerosis, Pulmonary Hypertension, Gene Therapy, Transplant, Hematological Agents, and others. Medical programs include Health Matters Care Management Preferred, Healthy Pregnancies Healthy Babies, Comprehensive Oncology Program, and Cigna's Gene Therapy Program with Embarc Benefit Protection."
